    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d83">

                <pb facs="0127" n="57" xml:id="pg57"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">724.3415/3553: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the President of the League of Nations Chaco Commission</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Alvarez del Vayo</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1934-02-26">February 26, 1934</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>I thank you sincerely for your courtesy in making available to our Ambassador in
                    Buenos Aires a copy of the draft treaty which your Commission has submitted to
                    the Governments of Bolivia and Paraguay looking to the reestablishment of peace
                    in the Chaco.</p>
                <p>My earnest hope and that of my Government is that the Commission will be
                    completely successful in these peace efforts.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Cordell Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
